# GPIOCommander

A touch-screen manager for the chip's GPIOs: every pin's digital level or
analog value at a glance, per-pin control of direction, pull, output level,
ADC, and PWM, a simple oscilloscope on the ADC channels, and a four-lane
logic analyzer on any GPIOs. Pins the board wires to its own display, touch,
codec, SD socket, or power circuit are shown but never reconfigured.
